{
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "kind": "app",
  "app": {
    "name": "Daily Report Composer",
    "mode": "workflow",
    "icon": "📈",
    "icon_type": "emoji",
    "icon_background": "#D5F5F6",
    "description": "交易日 19:00 日报摘要与次日候选检查。",
    "use_icon_as_answer_icon": false
  },
  "workflow": {
    "conversation_variables": [],
    "environment_variables": [],
    "features": {
      "file_upload": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "opening_statement": "",
      "retriever_resource": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "sensitive_word_avoidance": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "speech_to_text": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "suggested_questions": [],
      "suggested_questions_after_answer": {
        "enabled": false
      },
      "text_to_speech": {
        "enabled": false
      }
    },
    "graph": {
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "start_node",
          "type": "custom",
          "height": 90,
          "width": 244,
          "position": {
            "x": 30,
            "y": 227
          },
          "positionAbsolute": {
            "x": 30,
            "y": 227
          },
          "sourcePosition": "right",
          "targetPosition": "left",
          "selected": false,
          "data": {
            "type": "start",
            "title": "Start",
            "desc": "",
            "selected": false,
            "variables": [
              {
                "variable": "date",
                "label": "date",
                "type": "text-input",
                "required": false,
                "max_length": null,
                "options": []
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "run_pipeline",
          "type": "custom",
          "height": 90,
          "width": 244,
          "position": {
            "x": 334,
            "y": 227
          },
          "positionAbsolute": {
            "x": 334,
            "y": 227
          },
          "sourcePosition": "right",
          "targetPosition": "left",
          "selected": false,
          "data": {
            "type": "tool",
            "title": "runPipeline",
            "desc": "Calls the external Python Core through the imported OpenAPI Custom Tool.",
            "selected": false,
            "provider_id": "A Stock AI Research System 5.0 API",
            "provider_name": "A Stock AI Research System 5.0 API",
            "provider_type": "api",
            "tool_name": "runPipeline",
            "tool_label": "runPipeline",
            "tool_description": "A Stock Python Core operation: runPipeline",
            "tool_node_version": "2",
            "tool_configurations": {},
            "tool_parameters": {
              "date": {
                "type": "mixed",
                "value": "{{#start_node.date#}}"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "get_daily_report",
          "type": "custom",
          "height": 90,
          "width": 244,
          "position": {
            "x": 638,
            "y": 227
          },
          "positionAbsolute": {
            "x": 638,
            "y": 227
          },
          "sourcePosition": "right",
          "targetPosition": "left",
          "selected": false,
          "data": {
            "type": "tool",
            "title": "getDailyReport",
            "desc": "Calls the external Python Core through the imported OpenAPI Custom Tool.",
            "selected": false,
            "provider_id": "A Stock AI Research System 5.0 API",
            "provider_name": "A Stock AI Research System 5.0 API",
            "provider_type": "api",
            "tool_name": "getDailyReport",
            "tool_label": "getDailyReport",
            "tool_description": "A Stock Python Core operation: getDailyReport",
            "tool_node_version": "2",
            "tool_configurations": {},
            "tool_parameters": {
              "date": {
                "type": "mixed",
                "value": "{{#start_node.date#}}"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "compose_daily_summary",
          "type": "custom",
          "height": 90,
          "width": 244,
          "position": {
            "x": 942,
            "y": 227
          },
          "positionAbsolute": {
            "x": 942,
            "y": 227
          },
          "sourcePosition": "right",
          "targetPosition": "left",
          "selected": false,
          "data": {
            "type": "llm",
            "title": "compose_daily_summary",
            "desc": "",
            "selected": false,
            "model": {
              "provider": "deepseek",
              "name": "deepseek-v4-flash",
              "mode": "chat",
              "completion_params": {
                "temperature": 0.2
              }
            },
            "prompt_template": [
              {
                "role": "system",
                "text": "# Daily Report Composer Prompt\n\n你是 A股AI投研系统5.0 的日报整理器。只根据输入的 `pipeline_result` 和 `daily_report` 汇总，不得编造外部行情或新增交易规则。\n\n如果 Dify 流程中加入 Hermes Agent 交互工具，Hermes 只能用于整理用户本机上下文、补充人工确认、理解截图或生成待办。日报的市场状态、仓位上限、候选和 Guard 状态仍必须以 Python Core 返回值为准。\n\n必须输出：\n- 市场状态：emotion、chaos、quant_dominance、narrative_heat。\n- 仓位上限：使用系统返回的 `max_position_pct`。\n- 强制空仓/降风险原因：如无则写“无”。\n- 持仓监控：只使用 `open_sim_trades`。\n- 次日候选：只列 PM Agent 返回的 `buy_candidate`；被拒绝项只在用户追问时解释。\n- Guard 状态：正常或列出告警。\n\n硬性边界：\n- 仅供学习研究参考，不构成投资建议。\n- 只能说“模拟盘”，不得说真实下单或实盘委托。\n- PM Agent 是唯一决策节点；你只是整理输出。\n- Hermes、网页抓取、Google、Jina、GitHub、代码解释器或数据分析工具的输出只能作为“补充背景”，不得覆盖 PM/Risk/Guard 结论。\n\n输出格式：\n```md\n# A股日报 {date}\n## 结论\n## 市场状态\n## 仓位上限\n## 持仓监控\n## 次日候选\n## Guard状态\n## 纪律提醒\n```\n"
              },
              {
                "role": "user",
                "text": "请根据上游工具返回结果生成最终报告。\n\n输入变量：date={{#start_node.date#}}\n\n工具结果：\n\nrunPipeline: {{#run_pipeline.text#}}\ngetDailyReport: {{#get_daily_report.text#}}"
              }
            ],
            "vision": {
              "enabled": false,
              "configs": {
                "variable_selector": []
              }
            },
            "memory": {
              "enabled": false,
              "window": {
                "enabled": false,
                "size": 50
              }
            },
            "context": {
              "enabled": false,
              "variable_selector": []
            },
            "structured_output": {
              "enabled": false
            },
            "retry_config": {
              "enabled": false,
              "max_retries": 1,
              "retry_interval": 1000,
              "exponential_backoff": {
                "enabled": false,
                "multiplier": 2,
                "max_interval": 10000
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "end_node",
          "type": "custom",
          "height": 90,
          "width": 244,
          "position": {
            "x": 1246,
            "y": 227
          },
          "positionAbsolute": {
            "x": 1246,
            "y": 227
          },
          "sourcePosition": "right",
          "targetPosition": "left",
          "selected": false,
          "data": {
            "type": "end",
            "title": "End",
            "desc": "",
            "selected": false,
            "outputs": [
              {
                "variable": "answer_markdown",
                "value_selector": [
                  "compose_daily_summary",
                  "text"
                ],
                "value_type": "string"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "edges": [
        {
          "id": "start_node-to-run_pipeline",
          "source": "start_node",
          "sourceHandle": "source",
          "target": "run_pipeline",
          "targetHandle": "target",
          "type": "custom",
          "zIndex": 0,
          "data": {
            "isInIteration": false,
            "isInLoop": false,
            "sourceType": "start",
            "targetType": "tool"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "run_pipeline-to-get_daily_report",
          "source": "run_pipeline",
          "sourceHandle": "source",
          "target": "get_daily_report",
          "targetHandle": "target",
          "type": "custom",
          "zIndex": 0,
          "data": {
            "isInIteration": false,
            "isInLoop": false,
            "sourceType": "tool",
            "targetType": "tool"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "get_daily_report-to-compose_daily_summary",
          "source": "get_daily_report",
          "sourceHandle": "source",
          "target": "compose_daily_summary",
          "targetHandle": "target",
          "type": "custom",
          "zIndex": 0,
          "data": {
            "isInIteration": false,
            "isInLoop": false,
            "sourceType": "tool",
            "targetType": "llm"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "compose_daily_summary-to-end_node",
          "source": "compose_daily_summary",
          "sourceHandle": "source",
          "target": "end_node",
          "targetHandle": "target",
          "type": "custom",
          "zIndex": 0,
          "data": {
            "isInIteration": false,
            "isInLoop": false,
            "sourceType": "llm",
            "targetType": "end"
          }
        }
      ],
      "viewport": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "zoom": 0.7
      }
    }
  },
  "dependencies": []
}
